{"results":[{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/alliance-city-developers-realtors/alliance-bhaskar-131970","title":"Alliance Bhaskar, Malad West, Mumbai | 2 & 3 BHK Premium Apartments | Houssed","raw_content":"[![Houssed](/assets/images/houssed_logo.svg)](/)\n\n[![whatsapp](/assets/images/whatsapp.svg)Connect Now](https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=918169114718&text=Hi%2C+I%27m+looking+to+Buy+a+residential+property+in+Mumbai.+Please+connect+with+me.+Thanks%21&type=phone_number&app_absent=0)\n\n![Project Image of Alliance Bhaskar in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 255011](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/131970/Project%20Image/4-1746791561.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Project Image of Alliance Bhaskar in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 255010](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/131970/Project%20Image/3-1746791558.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Project Image of Alliance Bhaskar in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 255012](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/131970/Project%20Image/2-1746791564.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Amenities of Alliance Bhaskar in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 255013](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/131970/Amenities/1-1746791578.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Location of Alliance Bhaskar in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 255014](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/131970/Location/Hou-1746791615.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n## Project Overview of Alliance Bhaskar Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n26 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n0.19 Acres\n\nFreehold\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 18 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nAlliance Bhaskar, crafted by Alliance City Developers Realtors Pvt Ltd, stands as a testament to contemporary urban living in Mumbai's vibrant Malad West. This residential enclave offers thoughtfully designed 2, and 3 BHK apartments, seamlessly blending style and functionality to cater to the aspirations of modern families. Situated in a prime location, residents benefit from excellent connectivity to key city areas, ensuring convenience in daily commutes and access to essential amenities.  \n  \nThe development boasts a suite of premium amenities aimed at enhancing the lifestyle of its inhabitants. Features such as a private gymnasium, terrace garden, air-conditioned lobby, and advanced security systems, including 24x7 CCTV surveillance, underscore the project's commitment to comfort and safety. High-speed elevators and a dedicated society office further contribute to a seamless living experience, reflecting the developer's attention to detail and quality.  \n  \nAlliance Bhaskar's architectural design emphasizes open layouts and natural light, fostering a sense of spaciousness and tranquility amidst the urban hustle. The project's strategic location near educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and shopping centers adds to its appeal, making it an ideal choice for families seeking a harmonious blend of luxury and practicality in Mumbai's dynamic landscape.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Alliance Bhaskar Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Alliance Bhaskar in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 847179](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/131970/BHK_Configuration/2-bhk-Sample-1-1746791827.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n556 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.23 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Alliance Bhaskar in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 847184](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/131970/BHK_Configuration/3-BHK-Sample-2-1746792028.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n795 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.76 Cr\n\n## Key Features of Alliance Bhaskar Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Extravagant Skyline View.\n* Spectacular Design.\n* Spacious Homes.\n* Secured Environment.\n* Network Connectivity.\n* Sophisticated Lifestyle.\n\n## Amenities Alliance Bhaskar Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* 24X7 Water Supply\n* Lift\n* Security\n* Visitor Parking\n* Mud Playing Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Dth And Broadband Connection\n* Senior Citizens Walking Track\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Fireplace\n\n* Kids Play Area\n* Lattu Game\n* Game Corners\n* Indoor Games\n* Multipurpose Play Court\n* Carrom\n\n* Community Club\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Gym\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Organic Waste Convertor\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Laminate finish doors\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Stainless steel sink\n* False Ceiling\n* Concealed Electrification\n* TV Point\n* Telephone point\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Multi-stranded cables\n* Acrylic Emulsion Paint\n* Geyser Point\n\n## Google Map Location of Alliance Bhaskar Malad West\n\n## Locality Overview of Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Malad West](/location-review/mumbai/malad-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Malad West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Malad West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nAlliance Bhaskar is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800028213](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800028213)\n\nProject: Alliance Bhaskar\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Alliance Bhaskar Malad West\n\n---\n\n* Carmel Of St Joseph High School\n* Shri M.D. Shah Mahila College\n* D G Khetan International School\n* Ntcc High School\n\n* Lifeline Multispeciality Hospital - Charitable, Cashless Hospital\n* Zenith Hospital\n* Jankanyan Charitable Hospital\n* Vinayak maternity and general hospital\n\n* Udipi Shree Krishna\n* Parsley - The Lounge\n* Monopoly\n* Mozzarella Pizza Hub\n\n* Inorbit Mall\n* The Mall\n* Infiniti Mall\n* Vasant Plaza\n\n![Alliance City Developers Realtors](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/alliance-1727192800.webp)\n\n## [Alliance City Developers Realtors](/mumbai/sale/builder/alliance-city-developers-realtors-807248)\n\nOngoing Projects: 9\n\nCompleted Projects: 3\n\nTotal Projects: 12\n\n---\n\nFounded in 2010, Alliance City Developers Realtors Pvt Ltd has emerged as one of Mumbai's most dynamic real estate development companies. With a meticulous approach, the firm manages every aspect of the development process, from land acquisition to design, construction, and interior arrangements. Over the past decade, Alliance City has transformed the perceptions of Mumbai residents by delivering residential projects on time, featuring exclusive designs and high-quality standards.  \n  \nStrategically located, each project is equipped with essential amenities designed to enhance urban living. The team consists of talented professionals whose extensive experience encompasses all facets of real estate development. Their commitment to clear communication and efficient execution allows Alliance City to adeptly acquire, finance, develop, market, and manage sophisticated projects, ensuring a seamless experience for clients and stakeholders alike. Discover how Alliance City Developers can redefine your lifestyle in Mumbai’s vibrant real estate landscape.  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Alliance City Developers Realtors](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/alliance-city-developers-realtors-807248)\n\n## FAQ's about Alliance Bhaskar Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Malad West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Malad West\n\n* [Apartments in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n* [Studio Apartment in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property/studio-apartment)\n\n### Explore Projects in Malad West\n\n* [New Projects in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move)\n\n### Homes by BHK in Malad West\n\n* [1BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/1bhk)\n* [2BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/2bhk)\n* [3BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/3bhk)\n* [4+ BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/4-plus-bhk)\n* [4BHK Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/4bhk)\n\n### Homes by Budget in Malad West\n\n* [Homes in Malad West Above 5 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/above-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Malad West Between 1 Cr to 2 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/between-1-cr-to-2-cr)\n* [Homes in Malad West Between 2 Cr to 5 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/between-2-cr-to-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Malad West Between 50 Lakh to 1 Cr](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/budget/between-50-lakh-to-1-cr)\n\n### Homes by View in Malad West\n\n* [Green View Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property-view/green-view)\n* [Open View Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/property-view/open-view)\n\n### Explore N