3 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nIntroducing Alliance Bhaskar a thoughtfully designed project that offers well-planned living spaces at reasonable prices. Alliance Bhaskar brings a lifestyle fit for royalty with its exquisite apartments in Malad. Your home will become a perfect retreat after a long day at work, making you forget that you are in the heart of the city. These residential apartments offer luxurious living while providing an escape from the hustle and bustle of the city center. Additionally, living in this vibrant community comes with numerous advantages, including a prime location with excellent connectivity to key landmarks and essential services such as renowned hospitals, educational institutions, supermarkets, parks, entertainment venues, and recreational centers.\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2023\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹22,44,000/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n556 - 795 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* An address par excellence.\n* The pleasure of invisible care.\n* Not just an address, it's a prestigious landmark.\n* The perfect combination of comfort and style, specifically designed and convenient.\n\n* Perfection is second nature.\n* Spend your family time together.\n* Discover an exclusive life at a futuristic destination.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nOnline Review Summaries Location Convenience: Reviewers highlight the project's strategic position in Malad West, noting its proximity to the Malad railway station and the metro line. Living Experience: Residents generally report a positive atmosphere, describing the flat layouts as practical with good natural lighting. Service Quality: While the building itself is well-regarded, some feedback points to delays in maintenance responses and communication from the management team. Neighborhood Context: The area is described as a lively, high-density residential hub with easy access to markets, schools, and healthcare.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nExcellent Connectivity\n\nLocated within 5–10 minutes of both the Malad Railway Station and the Metro station.\n\nEssential Amenities\n\nFeatures fundamental facilities including 24/7 water supply, fire safety systems, and a kids' play area.\n\nSafety and Security\n\nReviews frequently mention a strong security presence and a family-friendly, well-lit environment.\n\nInfrastructure Access\n\nSituated near major landmarks like Liberty Garden, Inorbit Mall, and multi-specialty hospitals like Zenith.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nTraffic Congestion\n\nThe surrounding Malad West area suffers from high population density, leading to frequent traffic jams and noise pollution.\n\nMaintenance Delays\n\nSome residents have noted \"annoying\" delays in addressing maintenance requests post-possession.\n\nConstruction Noise\n\nOngoing development in the immediate vicinity can lead to noise disturbances during weekdays.\n\nParking Scarcity\n\nLike much of Mumbai, visitors and residents may find parking options limited or difficult to manage during peak hours.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nIdeal for Commuters\n\nSolid Mid-Range Option\n\nLocality Trade-off\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/Car-Parking-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Car-Parking-secondary.svg)\n\nCar Parking Space\n\n![amenities/Entrance-Lobby-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Entrance-Lobby-secondary.svg)\n\nEntrance Lobby\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![