row-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Alliance Bhaskar is 556 - 795 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Alliance Bhaskar?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Alliance Bhaskar is ₹1 Cr - 1.43 Cr\n\n### Where is Alliance Bhaskar located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nAlliance Bhaskar is located at Alliance Bhaskar, Liberty Garden Rd Number 1, Navy Colony, NSC Colony, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064.\n\n### What configurations are available in Alliance Bhaskar?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nAlliance Bhaskar has 2 BHK, 3 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Alliance Bhaskar?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Alliance Bhaskar is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Alliance Bhaskar?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Car Parking Space, Entrance Lobby, Gymnasium, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Senior citizen Area, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Alliance Bhaskar?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Alliance Bhaskar is Alliance City Developers Realtors.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Alliance Bhaskar:Alliance City Developers Realtors](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/270122111756-21.png)\n\n## Alliance City Developers Realtors\n\nAlliance City Developers Realtors is a premier real estate company in Mumbai with its main focus on providing projects with the highest standards of quality. The company aims to consistently make great strides in fulfilling the dreams of a large number of esteemed customers. It is armed with a team of talented professionals who are very knowledgeable and proficient in