h floor, One International Center, Tower-3, Senapati Bapat Marg, Mumbai, Maharashtra - 400013\n\nRERA ID : A51900029429\n\nOffice no 303, Platinum Square, Sakore Nagar, Viman Nagar, Pune, Maharashtra - 411014\n\nRERA ID : WBRERA/A/NOR/2026/000949\n\nOffice no : 7W84C, 7th Floor, West Block, Mani Casadona, Plot No. IIF/04, Action Area- IIF, Newtown, Kolkata, West Bengal - 700160\n\n---\n\n© Copyright 2026Blox.xyz","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/alliance-bhaskar/135568/project","title":"Alliance Bhaskar, Malad West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹1.50 Cr Onwards | 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Alliance City Developers Realtors developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/alliance-city-developers-realtors-10530.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Alliance Bhaskar Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Alliance Bhaskar Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/alliance-bhaskar--project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Alliance Bhaskar Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/alliance-bhaskar-project-tower-view1-5365.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Alliance Bhaskar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/alliance-bhaskar-project-amenities-features1-7974.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹1.50 Cr - 2.15 Cr**\n\n₹32,350 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Alliance Bhaskar?\n\n## About Alliance Bhaskar, Malad West by Alliance City Developers Realtors\n\nAlliance Bhaskar, a thoughtfully designed residential project, is nestled in the heart of Malad West, one of the most promising locations in suburban Mumbai. This project is strategically connected to major roads such as New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, and Western Express Highway, ensuring easy commuting to various parts of the city. With its unique blend of luxury and affordability, Alliance Bhaskar offers a modern and stylish living experience.\n\nThe project boasts of excellent amenities, including a well-equipped gymnasium, power backup, and convenient facilities to make your life easier. The interior specifications of the apartments are equally impressive, with features like oil-bound distemper painting on walls in the master bedroom, adding a touch of elegance to the space. Whether you re a corporate professional, a young family, or a retiree, Alliance Bhaskar has something to offer everyone.\n\nWith its prime location and modern amenities, Alliance Bhaskar is an ideal investment opportunity for those looking to purchase a residential property in Mumbai. So, come and experience the best of suburban living at Alliance Bhaskar, where comfort, convenience, and luxury blend seamlessly together.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Alliance Bhaskar:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 556 | 1.50 Cr |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 680 | 1.84 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 741 | 2.00 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 795 | 2.15 Cr |\n\nThe integrated residential project is surrounded by several iconic landmarks that cater to the diverse needs of its residents, offering a perfect blend of convenience, comfort, and luxury.\n\nWe have total 2 options available in Alliance Bhaskar for resale and rental, In resale we have no properties available. For rent you can check 2 properties having options for 2 BHK - 3 BHK with price ranging from 50000 to 65000.\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Listing Type | Total Listings | Unit Type Range | Price Range |\n| Rental | 2 | 2 BHK - 3 BHK | 50000 - 65000 |\n\nThe government-registered recent transactions in the real estate market reveal notable trends and statistics. Over the past three months, the current rental rate has remained consistent at 26,871, with a slight increase of + 129. Similarly, examining the six-month period also shows a steady current rate of 26,871, albeit with a relatively smaller price movement of + 67. However, analyzing the past year s transactions paints a more telling picture, with a single government-registered sales transaction worth 1 Cr, indicating a notable price movement of + 1,759. This data highlights the robust activity in the market, reflective of the growing demand for properties in the area.\n\n## Alliance Bhaskar Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Alliance Bhaskar.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  556 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.50 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  680 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.84 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  741 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.00 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  795 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.15 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nAlliance Bhaskar's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Alliance Bhaskar | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 32350 | 30550 |\n| Mar 2026 | 23100 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 22950 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 22900 | 27900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nAlliance Bhaskar avg. price is ₹ 32.4 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malad West at ₹ 30.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| Current Project **Alliance Bhaskar** | ₹ 32,350 |\n| [Chandak 34 Park Estate](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-34-park-estate/100855/project \"Chandak 34 Park Estate\") | ₹ 31,550 |\n| [Dosti Oro 67](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/dosti-oro-67/105339/project \"Dosti Oro 67\") | ₹ 31,100 |\n| Malad West | ₹ 30,550 |\n| [Paradigm Revive](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-revive/107077/project \"Paradigm Revive\") | ₹ 28,050 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Alliance Bhaskar start from ₹ 60 K with options available for 2 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Alliance Bhaskar | In Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 38.3 K |\n| 2 BHK | ₹ 60 K | ₹ 62.4 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 80.4 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Alliance Bhaskar.\n\nRent in Alliance Bhaskar ranges from ₹ 58 K to ₹ 65 K with options available for 2 BHK, 3 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Alliance Bhaskar moved from ₹ 23,100/sqft to ₹ 32,350/sqft, reflecting a 40.04% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nA total of 14 out of 26 launched units have been booked as of April 2026, including 50% of 3 BHK(2 out of 4), 52% of 2 BHK(11 out of 21), 100% of 1 BHK (1 units).\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Alliance Bhaskar moved from ₹ 22,950/sqft to ₹ 23,100/sqft, reflecting a 0.65% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Alliance Bhaskar moved from ₹ 22,900/sqft to ₹ 22,950/sqft, reflecting a 0.22% rise.\n\nExternal Works has reached 100%, Internal finishing stands at 100%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 100% done.\n\nStructural Works reach 80% completion, Internal finishing stands at 25%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 19% done.\n\n## Alliance Bhaskar Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 556 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Alliance Bhaskar, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/alliance-bhaskar-apartment-2-bhk-556sqft-20232801012809.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.50 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 680 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Alliance Bhaskar, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/alliance-bhaskar-apartment-2-bhk-680sqft-20232801012818.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.84 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 741 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Alliance Bhaskar, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/alliance-bhaskar-apartment-3-bhk-741sqft-20232801012827.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.00 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 795 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Alliance Bhaskar, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/alliance-bhaskar-apartment-3-bhk-795sqft-20232801012839.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.15 Cr\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Alliance Bhaskar\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Alliance Bhaskar, Mumbai.\n\n![2 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Alliance Bhaskar in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![PRIYANKA GUPTA  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Rent in Alliance Bhaskar in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![B