ty Around Alliance City Developers Realtors Malad West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Alliance Bhaskar.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Alliance Bhaskar](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/alliance-bhaskar--project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Father Angelo High School\n\n#### D Mart Shopping Centre\n\n#### Jeevan Nursing Home\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malad West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nBypass Road development & proposed highway\n\nAbsence of well developed public transport\n\nAndheri West appeals to me because my interactions are practical and lively. I have great colleges nearby, simple metro access, corporate offices etc. Weekends are spent at parks with family as well as at the beach. Though I adore this location, parking problems and noise have to be addressed quickly.\n\n— Smita Deo, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Alliance Bhaskar\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2025-09-22 | Floor 15, Unit 1501 | N/A | 680 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Alliance Bhaskar compare with similar projects?\n\n![Alliance Bhaskar project in Malad West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-alliance-bhaskar--project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Alliance Bhaskar](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/alliance-bhaskar/135568/project \"Alliance Bhaskar\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Rajesh Raj Infinia project in Malad West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rajesh-raj-infinia-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Rajesh Raj Infinia](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rajesh-raj-infinia/6536/project \"Rajesh Raj Infinia\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Godrej Tranquil project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-godrej-tranquil-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Godrej Tranquil](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/godrej-tranquil/8911/project \"Godrej Tranquil\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Alliance City Developers Realtors Track Record\n\n![Alliance City Developers Realtors logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/alliance-city-developers-realtors-10530.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nAlliance City Developers Realtors Pvt Ltd, a Mumbai-based real estate development company, has been making waves since its inception in 2010. With a focus on delivering residential projects that redefine the very essence of modern living, Alliance City Developers has quickly become one of the most prominent players in Mumbai real estate industry.Under their careful and meticulous guidance, every stage of the development process is flawlessly executed - from acquiring prime land to conceptualizing and designing innovative structures, to the actual construction and even the finer details of interior arrangements. The result is a collection of residential projects that boast exclusive designs and uncompromising quality, ultimately delighting its residents.Implementing a customer-centric approach, Alliance City Developers places immense importance on selecting strategic locations and offering an array of amenities that ensure a hassle-free and convenient lifestyle for their residents. Whether it proximity to