Alliance Bhaskar\n\n## Alliance Bhaskar\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Malad West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-malad-west-mumbai-l1442) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: Alliance City Developers](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-alliance-city-developers-d9515)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Malad West, Western Suburbs, Mumbai\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 1.45 Cr to 2.19 Cr\\*\n\n# Alliance Bhaskar in Malad West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Alliance Bhaskar](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/69164/1658468401_crown-kolshet-tower-1-elevation-136399388.jpeg \"Alliance Bhaskar\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n2 ,3 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 520 sqft - 789 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 14 Units & 1 Towers\n* Total Project Area: 0.19 Acres\n* Possession: June, 2023\n* Rera: P51800028213\n\n## About\n\nAlliance Bhaskar is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Malad West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 0.19 Acres, the project features 14 Units in 1 Towers, offering a mix of 2 BHK+2T, to 3 BHK+3T Apartments ranging from 520 sqft to 789 sqft. The address for the project is malad west, western suburbs, mumbai.\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Alliance Bhaskar are available in a variety of sizes. The 2 BHK+2T units start at 520 sqft. The larger 3 BHK+3T Apartments go up to 789 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Alliance Bhaskar are designed to be accessible, with 2 BHK+2T units priced from 1.45 Cr and 3 BHK+3T Apartments from 2.19 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Alliance City Developers, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800028213 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2023-06-14, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nAlliance Bhaskar is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 0.19 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 14 Units, 1 Towers\n* Sizes: 520 sqft to 789 sqft\n* Project Address: malad west, western suburbs, mumbai\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Alliance City Developers\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800028213 Units\n* Possession Start: 2023-06-14\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nAlliance Bhaskar benefits from its location in Malad West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Alliance Bhaskar will begin in 2023-06-14, and the project is RERA registered under P51800028213 Units. Developed by Alliance City Developers, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![CCTV](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528887020_cctv.svg) CCTV\n\n## Floor Plans of Alliance Bhaskar\n\n![Alliance Bhaskar Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/69164/1658468377_bhk2.jpeg \"Alliance Bhaskar Floor Plan 520 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (520 Sq. Ft.)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Alliance Bhaskar Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/69164/1658468377_bhk2.jpeg \"Alliance Bhaskar Floor Plan 715 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (715 Sq. Ft.)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 1.16 Cr\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Rental Listings →](https://rental.addressofchoice.com/property-for-rent-in-alliance-bhaskar-malad-west-mumbai-prop69164)\n\n## Bank Offers for Alliance Bhaskar\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958784_sbi.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958779_icici.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958773_hdfc.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958767_axis.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958761_canara.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958377_indiabulls.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958423_pnb.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958411_tata.png \" \")